# Auth & Roles

## Stack (existing)

- Custom JWT `AuthGuard` + `RolesGuard` (not Passport)
- Payload: `{ id, email, role }`
- Roles: `UserRole.ADMIN` | `UserRole.USER`
- `@Roles([...])` via Reflector decorator

## Rules

- `AuthGuard` before `RolesGuard`
- Signup must not trust client `role` unless an admin-only create path
- Use `@CurrentUser()` — don’t read `req.user` ad hoc in controllers
- Extend existing guards/decorators; don’t add a second auth system
- Never log tokens or reset codes

## Category policy (current)

- Writes: Admin + JWT
- Reads: public
